    "contributing": [
      "archiver_failure"
    ],
    "rationale": "The inactive slot's restart point is 6.5 hours old, so it pins about 41 GiB; the archiver backlog is only the last 49 minutes (about 7 GB at 2.5 MB/s), all inside the slot's range. The slot is the binding constraint: fixing archiving alone frees nothing, while restoring or dropping the slot frees ~34 GB. The failing archiver is a second, independent fault that becomes the binding constraint next and must be fixed too. The write rate is normal."
  },
